Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.72,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,The infinite universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:14.92,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Within the twinkling lights of these \Ncountless stars, there are many forms of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.28,0:00:20.64,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.64,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Hope...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:24.64,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Ambition...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.28,0:00:29.98,def2,{{DESLER,0,0,0,,War...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:39.18,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Despite housing all of them, the universe continues to exist endlessly in silence.{and quietly.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:48.52,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Because it is so vast, the universe sometimes leads us to coincidences that can only be called miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:54.78,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{souwa}Don't you think so, ladies and \Ngentlemen of the Bolar Federation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.88,0:01:03.76,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,As I've explained repeatedly, Planet Galman has an \Nideal environment for the survival of the people of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:08.50,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{masani}It's a miraculous match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.50,0:01:13.10,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{No matter how vast the universe is, there's no other planet that fits the criteria so well.} No matter how vast the universe is, there’s sure \Nto be no other planet that will fit the criteria so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:20.26,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{sore}That's because the people Galman and \NGarmillas are siblings that share common roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:26.10,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{kono}There's a theory that this planet \Ncould be the origin of the Garmillan people...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:29.42,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{kakono}...but let's leave the past out of this for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.06,0:01:36.28,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,For Bolar, this place is one of many resource planets located in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:39.90,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{ushinatte}I believe{presume} your loss will be minimal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:48.78,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{If you give it to us, Garmillas will make an alliance \Nwith Bolar, and we'll do our best to help you grow.} In exchange, Garmillas will forge an alliance with Bolar, and we'll do our best to help you expand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:05.16,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,I'm left begging for your help...{, in order to save the people of Garmillas, who are on the brink of extinction.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.16,0:02:08.92,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,...in order to save the people of Garmillas,\N who are on the brink of extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:12.76,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:21.68,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,The Bolar Federation's Permanent \NAdministration is indeed generous.{The Bolar Federation’s Eternal \NAdministration is indeed generous.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:24.76,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,We'll have mercy on Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:28.02,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Desler, pick up the choker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.84,0:02:31.42,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,"Alliance?" \NHow preposterous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:34.70,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,You'll work as Bolar's hands and feet until...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:41.62,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,You'd better not be thinking of anything foolish ! \NYour ship is surrounded by our fleet !{Your fleet is surrounded by ours !}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:47.37,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{koushou}You might be thinking of a surprise attack with your famed\N Desler Cannon in case this negotiation breaks down...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.37,0:02:50.88,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,...but we'll sink your ship the \Nmoment you start charging energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:54.30,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Now, King of Garmillas, it's your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:58.78,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Let's forget about your rude display.{Let's forget about your rudeness.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:01.14,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,The choker...pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.48,0:03:05.42,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Stop. \NDon't do it, Keel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:06.42,def2,{KEEL,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.76,0:03:07.90,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Gal. (5){Gal ji mel beo ay theo...}{This's my best guess. Countdown}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:09.28,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Ji. (4){This's my best guess. Countdown}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:10.42,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Nel. (3){This's my best guess. Countdown}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:11.62,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Beo. (2){This's my best guess. Countdown}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:12.82,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Al. (1){This's my best guess. Countdown}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:13.48,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Zeo. (0){This's my best guess. Countdown}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.46,0:03:28.70,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,What happened ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:31.68,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,I don't know !\N All communications just went down !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.42,0:03:35.44,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,What did you do, Desler ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:09.12,def2,{BERGER,0,0,0,,Let's break through. Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:19.18,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,Launch fighters !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:55.44,def2,{WOLF,0,0,0,,Our job is done.\N Let's enjoy the fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:05:00.82,def2,{GOL,0,0,0,,Poor Bolar. Times have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:11.72,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Desler, how dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:19.24,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Damn animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:23.76,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Governor Burroughs !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.80,0:05:31.64,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,So, this controller activates the poison\N injection of the chokers. How ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:38.18,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Brothers, the time of \Nendurance and obedience is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.36,0:05:51.48,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,The history that lies ahead will be made by people \Nwith blue blood and blue skin, working hand in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.16,0:05:57.14,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,You deserve nothing but fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.22,0:06:06.70,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,This is the first step\N to nation-wide liberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:08.16,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Let's go, Keel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.92,0:06:11.10,def2,{KEEL,0,0,0,,He deserves to be the king...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:16.78,def2,{KEEL,0,0,0,,...a true king who unites the\N people of Galman and Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:25.04,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}It all starts now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:29.70,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Planet Galman was liberated\N through your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:39.26,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}{We'll abandon our dying Planet Garmillas, and begin our grand plan for our entire population's migration to Planet Galman.}Leaving our dying Planet Garmillas behind will mark the start for our grand plan of migrating our entire population to Planet Galman.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:44.66,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Our fleet will temporarily leave this\N place in order to assist the emigration.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.12,0:06:50.82,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I'll leave the Dietz Fleet, dispatched from\N the home planet, to guard Planet Galman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:55.28,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Desler Fleet, set course for Planet Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:05.86,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,Bolar will most likely come back for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:08.82,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,I'm sure Dietz will hold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.78,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,It's strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.78,0:07:15.90,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,{To find a planet like this after two years of wandering.}...finding a planet like this after\N only two years of wandering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.90,0:07:18.92,def2,{TALAN,0,0,0,,That moon looks almost like...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.28,0:07:24.20,def2,{KLAUS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I forgot to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:29.02,def2,{KLAUS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}When you find a new planet,\N please plant some maleidel flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.46,0:07:32.08,def2,{KLAUS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Mother loved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:38.00,def2,{KLAUS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I'll look for a planet with it.\NThat way, I'll know which.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:43.24,def2,{KLAUS,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I hope to see you on our\N new home planet someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:50.56,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,Ranhalt, I can finally fulfill my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:58.32,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Those were his last words to you, which were discovered in Yamato's data bank after it had made it home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.78,0:08:03.96,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Earth still glows blue because he protected it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:06.88,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Führer Desler, where are you right now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:11.94,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}I hope this message reaches you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.10,0:08:18.52,def2,{DESLER,0,0,0,,That lad from the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.68,0:08:26.68,def2,{PEOPLE,0,0,0,,Yamato !
