Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:29.72,mactitle,{TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1242,874)}{DAOE-01}Supply Ship Asuka
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.27,0:09:34.22,mactitle,{TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1194,872)}{DCV-01} Battle Carrier Hyuga
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:44.64,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Of all things.\NWater{offshore} training for a space ship ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:47.80,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,It's nonsensical !{It's nonsense !}\NIt's so yesterday !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:52.32,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,Stay sharp ! You guys are the\N symbol of the reconstruction of Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:54.96,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,One for all, all for one !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:56.98,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Publicity stunt, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:58.42,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:09:59.52,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Oh, my butt...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.52,0:10:00.92,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Skinned your ass again ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:03.16,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:14.16,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,Official post-modification operations are complete.\NThe Yamato will rejoin the fleet tomorrow morning at 0600.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:19.40,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,It's time for Defense Fleet 65 to depart, isn't it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:22.46,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,Hyuga is the key to air power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:25.38,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,Asuka is in charge of supply and defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:29.96,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,I expect you two to do your\Njob well as captains of those ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:31.98,def2,{BOTH,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:36.10,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,Miss Mori, how do you feel \Nabout your role as a captain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.98,0:10:40.40,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,The ship's performance is more than \Nenough, and my crew is very capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:45.98,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm learning everything I can, so \NI won't be the only uncertain factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:53.72,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,{You might have some doubts about your triple promotion, but I think highly of your skills.}You might have some doubts about your triple bump promotion, but I hold your skills in high regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:57.08,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,I want you to do a good\N job supporting the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:10:59.04,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:03.72,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,By the way, have you had a chance\N to see the captain of the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:06.66,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,No, not recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:13.02,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,I see. That's understandable, \Ngiven how eager the press is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:21.00,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,It's good that Garmillas has found a place to migrate to, \Nbut the mood on Earth is not as pleasant as it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:24.70,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,{ooku no} Many people are worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.90,0:11:28.50,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,{mata}...that we might be caught in a war again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:33.62,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,{sore}That's why public attention to this \Ndelegation is very high these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:40.24,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,{senden}Some people make fun of you, calling you a publicity fleet, but I know I can rely on you when needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:47.68,def2,{TOUDOU,0,0,0,,We must avoid any situations where those kids have to be sent to the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:51.50,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,Those will be your assignments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:57.16,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,Boarding time is 0600 tomorrow morning. \NThis six month training voyage won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:11:59.96,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,Make sure you enjoy yourselves tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:01.72,def2,{KITANO,0,0,0,,Dismissed !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.80,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,My god, the Yamato, and I'll\N be in the engine department.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.80,0:12:08.72,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,Your dream's come true, huh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:10.68,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Yeah, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:15.44,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Those guys represent the \Npublicity fleet's splendid reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:20.22,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,The son of the Yamato's deceased\Nchief engineer{chief} is assigned to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:21.86,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,How emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.56,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:27.66,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,People love that type of tear-jerker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.20,0:12:30.80,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter who his father is !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:33.90,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,He works hard because it's his\N dream to be on board the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.90,0:12:36.38,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,That's the same for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:42.28,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,If your father was a Yamato crewman, you could have been assigned to a position that'd stand out more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:44.96,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Bando, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:47.40,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,How dare you ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:48.36,def2,{MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Not again ! {Bando: Shut up!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:49.42,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Bando, stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.42,0:12:50.66,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, Tasuke !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:54.54,def2,{TASUKE,0,0,0,,Bando, that's enough !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.64,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,Wanna know about my father ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:58.80,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,He was killed on board the Achilles !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.22,0:13:01.42,def2,{HEIJI,0,0,0,,You think that's lesser than the Yamato ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:06.10,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Are you nuts ?!\NStuff like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:12.36,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,You want to be thrown out for\N causing problems before you leave ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:13.98,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:17.10,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,I can't accept the fact that he got this\Nassignment without having any real skills !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.62,0:13:22.74,def2,{AIHARA,0,0,0,,They're so spirited, aren't they ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:25.02,def2,{NANBU,0,0,0,,If you have any complaints, I'll listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:29.18,def2,{MEN,0,0,0,,Ex...excuse us !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:41.38,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,It's tough on the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:44.18,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,You'd better be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:45.26,def2,{MEN,0,0,0,,Aye, sir !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:49.68,def2,{MIYAKO,0,0,0,,What're you guys doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.92,0:13:52.04,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,So, he's Tokugawa's son, eh ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.76,0:14:04.58,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,I don't like this mood.\N It's so tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:08.68,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,I can understand their feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:11.88,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,A lot has happened since the war with Gatlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:13.96,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:16.62,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,I guess one voyage should help them grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:20.06,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,Right. \NBy the way, how is Captain Kodai ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:24.50,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,He shoved all his chores on me and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:29.14,def2,{SHIMA,0,0,0,,He went through a lot,\N so he's probably "there.”
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.62,0:14:43.24,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,{I'm leaving tomorrow.}I’m departing tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:47.48,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,We're heading for Garmillas and Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.34,0:14:52.62,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,It's the route you and I took six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:57.74,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,But everything has changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:15:02.54,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,...including the Earth and me as a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:06.32,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Captain Okita, am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:11.46,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:13.46,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,I knew you'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.72,0:15:20.42,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Is it okay for you to be here ?\NYou know tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:22.42,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,How about you, Kodai ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:28.50,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,You're not okay. \NThat's why you came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:33.12,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.82,0:15:46.04,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,How many months has it \Nbeen since we were alone together ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.82,0:15:49.70,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,We could be photographed even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.42,0:15:54.82,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,It can't be helped. After all, we're the\N most expensive couple in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:15:59.62,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,The Time{Dimensional} Fault is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:05.44,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,It had supported our post-war economy\Nand military strength, but Earth abandoned{ditched} it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:11.06,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,I'm responsible for that because\N I tried to stay in the higher dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.92,0:16:12.72,def2,{YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:18.32,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,I know. It was a decision made by\N everyone on Earth, and I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.38,0:16:25.48,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,But I have to bear the responsibility for the\N cost Earth had to pay for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:26.92,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Can you really ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:32.26,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{Can one person take responsibility \Nfor the entire human race ?}Can one person really shoulder all\Nresponsibility for the entire human race ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:34.26,def2,{KODAI,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:16:59.92,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,It's the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.88,0:17:03.10,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Looks like it's been restored quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.22,0:17:09.62,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Yamato...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.14,0:17:11.66,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,, Oh, it's the Ginga.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:18.72,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,What ? Not here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:25.36,def2,{KANZAKI,0,0,0,,"Given recent developments of interstellar relationships, any demonstration of technological exchange with Garmillas should be discouraged.”
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:27.30,def2,{KANZAKI,0,0,0,,{toiunoga}That's the brass's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:31.92,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,So the technology licensing itself is cancelled ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.92,0:17:37.07,def2,{SAKII,0,0,0,,No. The skills you've gained{acquitted} \Non Garmillas are irreplaceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:40.78,def2,{SAKII,0,0,0,,The experiment will be carried out on \Nschedule outside the Solar System.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:43.42,def2,{KANZAKI,0,0,0,,Another group is waiting for you just for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.42,0:17:46.12,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Another...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:49.86,def2,{SAKII,0,0,0,,Defense Fleet 65. \NThe flagship is the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.58,0:17:53.44,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Yamato ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.78,0:18:00.50,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}That's how I ended up going \Naboard the Yamato tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:03.76,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}The experiment will be \Nconducted on the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:10.70,def2,{WOMAN,0,0,0,,Mutiny ? \NThen why someone like him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.14,0:18:14.68,def2,{WOMAN,0,0,0,,The fallout from his betrayal \Nled him to migrate to Garmillas…{The betrayal led him to migrate to Garmillas...}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:17.52,def2,{WOMAN,0,0,0,,{ageku}...on top of that, he became\N an expert in military secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:20.07,def2,{WOMAN,0,0,0,,And he's bringing it to Earth ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.07,0:18:23.70,def2,{WOMAN,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a reward for his \Ncontribution to Garmillas's migration policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:28.98,def2,{KANZAKI,0,0,0,,Yamato, of all places,\N will be like hell for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:38.34,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.44,0:18:43.00,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,It's a tough time for Garmillas, but you \Ndon't have to worry about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.06,0:18:45.63,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Did you know ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:51.06,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,When you feel the worst, something \Nwonderful is right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.74,0:18:57.78,def2,{YABU,0,0,0,,Your dad is doing his best, so hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.02,0:18:55.87,Karaoke Translation op,{YABU,0,0,0,,{\pos(988,892)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000008&}Planet Garmillas of the Magellanic Cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:04.28,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}The evacuation ship will depart as \Nscheduled Eastern Standard Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:06.00,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&\1a&H00&}First class citizens...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:08.40,def2,{ODDO,0,0,0,,Guys, hurry up, or we'll miss the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.40,0:19:10.62,def2,{LIZA,0,0,0,,Can you wait just a bit, big brother Oddo ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:20.44,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Progress of evacuation is only 30%. \NWe're behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:23.84,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,Prepare for the announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:28.58,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,The core's meltdown is \Nincreasing at an accelerated rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:31.56,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,{It's not a matter of 50 years in the future.}It’s no longer a matter \Nof 50 years into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.16,0:19:33.18,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,5 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:38.52,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,No, inform the people that there will be\Na catastrophic meltdown in 5 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:40.44,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,But that might....
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.44,0:19:43.66,def2,{HISS,0,0,0,,That's the only way to save\N as many people as we can !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:46.48,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,But President Hiss, I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:53.38,def2,{HILDE,0,0,0,,Is the life of our planet really going to end ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:58.52,def2,{TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Planet Iscandar: Imperial Capital Isk San Aria
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.30,0:20:02.56,def2,{MELDA,0,0,0,,Planet Galman is still under Bolar control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:07.88,def2,{MELDA,0,0,0,,It could be a battlefield by the\N time the evacuation fleet arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:12.74,def2,{MELDA,0,0,0,,In the worst case scenario,\N Iscandar might have to be a temporary shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.84,0:20:18.28,def2,{YURISIA,0,0,0,,So the dispute over Planet Galman\N has escalated that much...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:24.42,def2,{STARSIA,0,0,0,,The more he tries to redeem himself, the more he sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.30,0:21:09.58,def2,{YURIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Toru, what are you doing ? \NI'll be late for the assembly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.44,0:21:12.38,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,Domon...Domon...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.64,0:21:17.46,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,Domon Hightech ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.48,0:21:22.42,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}It was affiliated with the military and manufactured parts used at a factory in the Time{Dimensional} Fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:28.64,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFE9F&}Domon Ryusuke is the sole son of the company president, and\Nhe's been assigned to the combat department on the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:34.88,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,Domon Hightech went out of business because of the disappearance of the Time{Dimensional} Fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:37.62,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,{shachou}Company President Domon Ryuzo...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.90,0:21:39.88,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,...committed suicide ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.24,0:21:44.04,def2,{HOSHINA,0,0,0,,It was supposed to be an accident, \Na possible suspected suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:48.00,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,His son'll be on the Yamato...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.06,def2,{MAN,0,0,0,,Look, it's the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:22:02.58,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,Domon Ryusuke wouldn't have been assigned to the Yamato because of an incident like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.66,0:22:06.82,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,The disappearance of the Time{Dimensional}\N Fault is due to the Yamato's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.52,0:22:09.68,def2,{SANADA,0,0,0,,Oh, no !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.34,0:22:34.74,def2,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.22,0:22:44.82,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\pos(714,1048)\3c&H000008&}A Galactic War is About to Break Out!    Assemble the Yamato Fleet!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.22,0:22:44.82,Karaoke Translation op,{RYUSUKE,0,0,0,,{\fscx113\fscy112\pos(210,874)\3c&H000008&}Episode 1
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.20,0:22:58.60,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kanashimi no ushiro de itsumo}Behind the sorrow...\N{\i1}kanashimi no ushiro de itsumo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.12,0:23:04.70,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{tsugi wa shiawase ga matteiru}...happiness is always waiting for you{next}\N{\i1}tsugi wa shiawase ga matteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:17.62,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{sonna guuwa wo shinjitsuni kaemashou}Let's turn that fairy tale into truth\N{\i1}sonna guuwa wo shinjitsuni kaemashou
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.24,0:23:29.28,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{anata no me ga mabushisouni sasayaku}You whisper with a spark in your eye\N{\i1}anata no me ga mabushisouni sasayaku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.14,0:23:46.78,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{yume wo miru no wa kizutsuku tame janai}You don’t dream to get hurt\N{\i1}yume wo miru no wa kizutsuku tame janai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.10,0:23:55.66,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ai wa ima mo hikari}Love still shines even now\N{\i1}ai wa ima mo hikari
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.67,0:24:02.78,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{tada hitotsu no inori}There’s only one prayer\N{\i1}tada hitotsu no inori
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.78,0:24:11.89,def2,SONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{mirai wa mou hajimatte iru}The future has already begun\N{\i1}mirai wa mou hajimatte iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.92,0:22:56.02,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a3\pos(760,914)}Susumu Kodai: \NYuki Mori: \NDaisuke Shima: \NShiro Sanada: \NYasuo Nanbu:\NYoshikazu Aihara: \NKenichiro Ohta:\NHeikuro Todo:\NSaki Todo: \NMegumi Kanzaki: \NMina Ichinose: \NUrara Kusakabe:\NRyusuke Domon: \NTasuke Tokugawa: \NHeiji Bando: \NMiyako Kyozuka: \NTetsuya Kitano: \NToru Hoshina: \NYuria Hoshina:
